', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'asas al taweel volume 1 adam what ismaili interpretation is', 'what ismaili interpretation is the editors introduction to asas al tawil arif tamirs 1960 beirut framing of why this 10th century fatimid treatise on inner interpretation was kept in private custody for a thousand years what the ismailis mean by tawil as distinct from tafsir why the speaker bears revelation and the imam foundation bears its inner meaning and how al numans two books daaim al islam and this one together form the body and soul of the fatimid intellectual project sets up the six speaker prophet chapters that follow adam noah ibrahim moses jesus muhammad the seventh chapter on the awaited imam is deliberately unwritten', '');
', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'asas al taweel volume 1 adam the call to inner meaning', 'the call to inner meaning al numans own opening of asas al tawil he explains why he wrote a second book after his apparent law volume daaim al islam why inner interpretation has to be taught by stages milk before solid food suckling for two years symbols before subtleties and why the testimony there is no god but allah from the very first day the prophet spoke it already contained the whole sacred law against the common opinion that says the easy creed came first and the heavy obligations later sets up the structural claim that the next chapter will unfold that every created thing is paired outward and inward body and soul and that the creator is described by none of the pairs', '');
', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'asas al taweel volume 1 adam the four limits of the shahada', 'the four limits of the shahada al numan opens the testimony itself and shows what is inside it the shahada has four words those four words stand for four limits two above and two below above are the pen and the preserved tablet named in the prophetic hadith that says the first thing god created was the pen below are the speaker the prophet who articulates the sacred law in his time and the silent one the imam foundation who is master of its interpretation to recognize all four is to complete the shahada the philosophers affirmed the upper two and called them intellect and soul but denied the lower two and so left the testimony broken the chapter then maps the seven speaker prophets across history adam noah ibrahim moses jesus muhammad and the awaited al qaim and the seven imams in each cycle the twelve successors arranged as proofs in every age and the seven plus twelve nineteen that the quran names it closes on the second testimony to the messenger as the branches of the first and on al sadiqs verdict that faith encompasses islam but islam does not encompass faith', '');
', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'asas al taweel volume 1 adam adam the tree and the pact of iblis', 'adam the tree and the pact of iblis al numan opens his interpretation of the prophetic cycles at the origin of the lower hadd of imamate itself adam peace be upon him the quranic scene of the angels objection the formation of adam from clay the long pause before the spirit the teaching of the names ibliss refusal to prostrate the creation of eve the garden the forbidden tree the pact of respite the fall the repentance every element is read on its inner side the hadd that iblis vacated is filled by eve as adams twelve rank hujja the garden is the rank of supportive knowledge al tayid the tree is not wheat fig or grape but a likeness for the master of the resurrection the disclosure entrusted to him alone seized prematurely adams stripping is the loss of the garment of piety which is the word his repentance restores him to the rank of caliph and imam and the imamate begins from him as the architecture of the four limits requires', '');
', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'asas al taweel volume 1 adam the two parties and the line to noah', 'the two parties and the line to noah al numan closes the first prophetic cycle he develops the two parties doctrine at length threading together the qurans own naming of hizb allah against the party of satan he refuses the popular literalism that froze the forbidden tree into wheat fig or grape and read human fingernails as its residue he refuses by name the inherited jewish source tale of adam and eve hiding naked among the trees while god walked there asking where are you calling out kab al ahbar and abdullah ibn salam as the channels through which the material entered the tradition he rehabilitates adam to the rank of caliph and imam he gives the chain of five upper and five lower limits in the prophets own voice he walks the lineage from adam through seth idris enoch and the seven imams of the first cycle down to lamech who completes the cycle and hands the matter to noah then he opens the chapter on noah hud and salih and the listener hears noahs people refuse him in the same shape iblis had refused god you are nothing but a human being like us the architectures claim on history begins to walk', '');
